#!/usr/bin/env python3
"""
Manchester editor, Exon menu: "Predict effect of removing" (PTC / NMD / expression), and Remove exon
re-translating the ORF with the same analysis.

    sudo python3 install-exon-predict.py /opt/baja-apps   (production)
    python3 install-exon-predict.py ~/baja-apps           (local)

Writes baja/bio/orfs/exon-removal-impact.js and retranslate-after-exon-change.js, and edits
baja/manchester/menu/menu-factory.js (backed up as menu-factory.js.before-exon-predict). Works with or
without the earlier Remove-exon installer. Needs the BajaSplice Exon-menu update. Safe to run twice.
"""
